# Keep every file byte-identical across platforms.
#
# Why: tools/selfcheck.js matches /const DB = ...;\n/ on index.html.
# With git's default core.autocrlf=true on Windows, checkout rewrites LF to
# CRLF, the file becomes ";\r\n", the regex fails, and selfcheck wrongly
# reports "cannot find const DB". Disabling text conversion keeps LF.
* -text
